<title>INDIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>INDIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970501-2)</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 25 Jul 92)...........Shankar Dayal SHARMA</p>
<p> Vice President........Kocheril Raman NARAYANAN</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>UNITED FRONT ALLIANCE GOVERNMENT:</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Sworn in 21 Apr 97)........Inder Kumar GUJRAL</p>
<p>(Also in charge of ministries/departments of Atomic</p>
<p>Energy, Personnel, Public Grievances &amp; Pensions, Urban</p>
<p>Affairs &amp; Employment as well as all other ministries/</p>
<p>departments not allocated to any other cabinet minister</p>
<p>or minister of state with independent charge viz.</p>
<p>Civil Supplies, Consumer Affairs &amp; Public Distribution,</p>
<p>Electronics, External Affairs, Food, Jammu &amp; Kashmir</p>
<p>Affairs, Labour, Ocean Development, Petroleum &amp; Natural</p>
<p>Gas, Power &amp; Space.)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET:</p>
